        <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"><path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"/></svg>
        <h4>Hand-curated displays</h4>
        <p>Every arrangement is placed by hand, not dropped at the door. Our team styles each display for your specific entry.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mtw-campaign-why__card">
        <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/></svg>
        <h4>Install weeks, not days</h4>
